{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方最大号的白字标题，紫色强调的“不再需要他陪”“不自在”尤其醒目。随后中间的灰白大句和底部黄色强调的大字也会争夺注意力。右上角目录较弱。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他担心有一天对方不再需要自己陪，甚至会觉得和自己待在一起不自在。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"没底、不安；是否同时有高兴，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"两人眼下其实仍然亲近，对方一直没有退开；他想到这些现实后，觉得对方也许喜欢自己在身边，因此有一点高兴。中间的突然安静和不敢继续往下想，也需要进一步读取。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线：顶部标题、中间大句、底部黄色强调句。\",\n    \"单块偏长，一块里有好几层意思。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在几块里，需要把顶部的担忧、中间的安静和底部的高兴拼起来，才能理解完整的心理变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cb92f60b-bc72-4eb2-8d73-b540c3a487ce", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T011514867538Z", "elapsed_seconds": 64.281, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:16:19.140280+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c1a4f8dd1512f620fc2db291e473b4cc0cbfd2011be315fa2ace969e466341cb", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9